  <h4>LET CEM WORK FOR YOU</h4>
  <p>CEM conducts on-site workplace evaluations to ensure occupational health hazards are anticipated, recognized, evaluated, and controlled. Our goal is to prevent and control occupational injuries and illnesses by developing and implementing practical and cost-effective IH solutions. This includes promoting good industrial hygiene work practices in occupational populations, and conducting advanced, integrated, and sustainable workplace health and safety evaluations.</p>
  <p>CEM’s goal is no different than your team which is to disseminate and communicate targeted health and safety information by working cooperatively with your team to ensure compliance with applicable federal and state laws, the OHSAS 18001 framework, and codified regulations. Our approach is to be a value-added “one-stop shop” for all of your IH requirements, and implement “best practices” whenever possible.</p>
</PageLayout>
